---
import site from '../data/site.json';
const rawBase = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = rawBase.endsWith('/') ? rawBase.slice(0, -1) : rawBase;
---
<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow">CERN-OHL-P v2 · CC BY 4.0 · research prototype</div>
    <h1>{site.tagline}</h1>
    <p class="hero-meta">
      {site.project}: {site.project_expansion} · flown on {site.flight.campaign} parabolic flights · printed moulds, cast silicone
    </p>
    <p class="lead">
      In reduced gravity, menstrual fluid is held by surface tension and adhesion
      rather than drained by weight. The SpaceCup is a reusable silicone cup with
      a mechanism that closes its opening before the cup is removed. Seven
      closing mechanisms were designed and six bench-tested; the two Flower designs
      scored highest ({site.bench.flower_score}/{site.bench.score_max}), and
      {site.flight.design_flown} was flown.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={site.repo}>Get the files on GitHub →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#background">Background</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-secondary">
      Every part is cast from 3D-printed moulds; the mould files, the editable
      CAD and the casting guide are all in the repository.
    </p>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-photo">
    <img
      src={`${base}/renders/flower-low.png`}
      alt="Render of the Flower Low SpaceCup: a grey silicone cup with five magenta petals at its opening; their silicone pull strings, which join the pull mechanism in the stem, are shown straight, as cast."
      width="2000" height="2000" loading="eager"
    />
    <figcaption>Flower Low, the design flown on the parabolic flights (render).</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: 40px;
  }
  .hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .hero h1 { margin: 14px 0 12px; }
  .hero-meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: .01em;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .hero .lead { font-size: 17px; }
  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 24px 0 18px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--ghe-white); }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: .9; }
  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--fg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-secondary {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hero-photo {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .hero-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }
  .hero-photo figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }
</style>
